Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.00,0:01:36.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,眉頭皺得這麼緊 可惜了這麼可愛的臉蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.50,0:01:42.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,來 笑一個 好不好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.30,0:01:43.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肯恩大人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.83,0:01:44.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是他
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.65,0:01:53.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你…你…你幹什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.00,0:02:01.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那果然只是不小心碰到的意外
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.91,0:02:03.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,意外？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.63,0:02:06.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在努力了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.61,0:02:09.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使被嘲笑 也在努力著
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.25,0:02:15.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算我這麼喜歡大谷
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.18,0:02:17.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,還是不會有任何改變
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.38,0:02:19.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小泉…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.00,0:02:21.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,夠了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.67,0:02:24.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我受夠了 我放棄
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.85,0:02:28.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我再也不要喜歡大谷了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.74,0:02:32.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我放棄
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.37,0:02:38.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,危險男子 MAITY的甜蜜誘惑
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.85,0:02:43.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,米飯
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.29,0:02:45.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想起來了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.67,0:02:48.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我感冒那天小泉在我家的時候
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.78,0:02:52.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.36,0:02:56.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也是像這樣 小泉的臉就在我眼前
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.73,0:02:59.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然後
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.97,0:03:06.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小泉的頭髮這邊 黏著一顆亮晶晶的米粒
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.57,0:03:08.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,黏著一顆米粒
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.38,0:03:10.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,黏著一顆米粒
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.93,0:03:13.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,米飯…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.65,0:03:13.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在幹什麼呀
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.26,0:03:15.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早餐我要吃麵包
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.54,0:03:17.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,身為日本人 早餐就應該吃米飯和味噌湯
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.10,0:03:19.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這句話不是你說的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.73,0:03:20.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我再也不要吃米飯了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.97,0:03:26.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我就一邊想要糗你 一邊要把米拿下來
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.39,0:03:28.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,結果腦袋就一陣眩暈
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.71,0:03:32.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的初吻 居然只是個意外
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.20,0:03:34.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是為了要親吻
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.80,0:03:38.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是為了要幫我拿掉頭髮上黏的米粒
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.14,0:03:41.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不小心碰到我的嘴唇
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.25,0:03:44.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這怎麼可能
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.66,0:03:46.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.67,0:03:50.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是因為上次姐姐玩的遊戲裡的什麼大人喜歡麵包嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.43,0:03:59.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,說的也是
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.69,0:04:03.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肯恩大人的早餐一定是可頌麵包加咖啡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.75,0:04:05.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,從今天起 我也要配合他才行
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.94,0:04:08.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不然等結了婚 可就傷腦筋了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.78,0:04:11.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,姐姐真的是有問題啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.18,0:04:14.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,理莎 快回來 理莎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.48,0:04:16.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回到現實世界來
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.40,0:04:19.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是小泉理莎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.78,0:04:20.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,17歲
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.81,0:04:22.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,身高172
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.41,0:04:25.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是個尺寸偏大的女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.88,0:04:29.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其實 我現在有個非常喜歡的人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.20,0:04:30.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就是
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.32,0:04:34.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,MAITY老師
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.64,0:04:44.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早安
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.78,0:04:46.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早安
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.67,0:04:49.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和肯恩大人長得一模一樣的MAITY老師
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.31,0:04:51.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天還是一樣的迷人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.81,0:04:54.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太好了 你看起來很有精神呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.00,0:04:57.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咦？我一直都很有精神的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.53,0:04:59.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你昨天哭了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.72,0:05:00.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎麼知道
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.84,0:05:04.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你從走廊跑過的時候 我剛好也在
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.53,0:05:08.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你願意的話 可以找我商量
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.79,0:05:10.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不開心的話 隨時可以過來
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.46,0:05:14.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,MAITY老師
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.60,0:05:16.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,心動
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.33,0:05:15.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.86,0:05:21.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的 我非常喜歡MAITY老師
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.44,0:05:25.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小泉 我有點話想和你說
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.57,0:05:31.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,欸 奇怪 好像有人在說話 是錯覺吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.97,0:05:34.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,還是躲在哪裡小角落裡呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.03,0:05:36.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟那種無謂的事情比起來
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.66,0:05:39.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,MAITY老師 今天也很期待你的講課
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.90,0:05:41.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,謝謝你
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.20,0:05:44.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,強吻別人 居然還無視別人的存在
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.61,0:05:50.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,親吻？強吻？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.40,0:05:52.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是這樣的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.55,0:05:54.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你！胡說什麼呢 在MAITY老師面前
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.44,0:05:57.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什麼嘛 你做完就想跑嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.58,0:05:59.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,給我閉嘴！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.93,0:06:04.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好痛 你在幹什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.68,0:06:06.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,囉嗦 只是要你閉嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.07,0:06:10.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然是搞笑二人組 感情真好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.14,0:06:12.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你們是在交往嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.57,0:06:14.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,才沒有在交往 感情也不好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.90,0:06:16.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,更不是搞笑二人組
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.34,0:06:20.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了 要上課了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.94,0:06:26.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算了 已經夠了 像個笨蛋一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.17,0:06:30.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我再也不要喜歡這個笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.89,0:06:32.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算想起他都是在浪費時間
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.56,0:06:35.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,欸？放棄了？ 是什麼意思
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.33,0:06:38.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什麼意思 為什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.86,0:06:41.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我告訴你們 青春是很短暫的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.41,0:06:45.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟在他屁股後面追要追到什麼時候
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.83,0:06:49.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很快我就會變成老太婆了 真是傻啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.39,0:06:52.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,糟了 又開始胡思亂想了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.90,0:06:56.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,理莎 求求你快恢復過來 理莎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.37,0:06:58.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼了 又發生了什麼事
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.90,0:07:04.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒什麼 我只是受夠了大谷的愚蠢而已
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.83,0:07:07.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的假的 你先等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.45,0:07:10.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 理莎 都已經努力到這份上了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.88,0:07:15.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我受夠了 再也不理他了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.18,0:07:21.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,從今天起 我要向新的戀情邁出第一步
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.83,0:07:22.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,新的戀情？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.05,0:07:23.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第一步？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.94,0:07:28.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,MAITY老師幾歲了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.61,0:07:30.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你覺得呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.94,0:07:32.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,23歲差不多？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.48,0:07:34.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就算是好了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.54,0:07:36.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咦 不是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.25,0:07:36.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,差那麼一點
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.89,0:07:40.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又出現了 那讓人雞皮疙瘩一地的氛圍
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.04,0:07:43.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是24?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.71,0:07:44.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,猜對了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.54,0:07:46.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她什麼時候跑去的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.18,0:07:51.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,難道說新的戀情是跟MAITY老師？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.14,0:07:57.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行 不行不行不行 媽媽堅決反對
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.84,0:08:00.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,媽媽？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.89,0:08:08.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因為 我已經盡了最大的努力了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.35,0:08:16.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再怎麼努力 也不會有任何改變
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.00,0:08:21.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼了 在裝憂鬱啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.74,0:08:23.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不用裝都憂鬱
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.38,0:08:24.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,發生了什麼事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.13,0:08:29.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我被小泉強吻了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.88,0:08:34.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大谷你真是常被人強吻啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.44,0:08:37.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上次是被聖子強吻的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.70,0:08:41.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等一下 我到底在發什麼呆啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.84,0:08:42.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然後呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.57,0:08:45.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,為什麼會發生那樣的事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.85,0:08:52.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 具體我也不太清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.56,0:08:55.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像是什麼時候 我有親過小泉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.28,0:08:57.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也不太清楚？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.10,0:08:58.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什麼意思
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.52,0:09:02.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那天我感冒發燒 根本不記得
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.84,0:09:04.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 無意識偷襲？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.65,0:09:05.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你這個畜生
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.23,0:09:08.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,才不是 怎麼說呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.65,0:09:12.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真的這麼沒有魅力嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.19,0:09:18.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嚴格說起來 應該是我被侵犯的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.17,0:09:22.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咦 小泉真的很努力
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.05,0:09:25.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她一定是非常喜歡大谷吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.49,0:09:31.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小泉真的很努力
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.67,0:09:33.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他一定是非常喜歡大谷吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.72,0:09:35.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吵死了 這我知道啦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.86,0:09:38.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦 原來你知道啊 嚇了我一跳
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.24,0:09:42.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你自己說的啊 你在發呆
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.33,0:09:43.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我還沒待到那種程度
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.54,0:09:53.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不過 她說她放棄了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.65,0:10:00.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我放棄 放棄 說ByeBye
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.61,0:10:05.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家好 感謝大家的出席
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.89,0:10:11.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是MAITY部的部長 小泉理莎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.53,0:10:16.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天為了紀念MAITY部的成立
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.73,0:10:19.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我們特地邀請到MAITY老師本人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.05,0:10:23.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那麼 大家一起叫MAITY老師的名字
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.20,0:10:24.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,1 2 3
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.29,0:10:27.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,MAITY!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.09,0:10:30.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.75,0:10:34.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,來來來
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.09,0:10:37.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有問題想問MAITY老師的 請舉手！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.50,0:10:40.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這麼多人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.55,0:10:43.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老師 你有正在交往的人嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.40,0:10:45.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.70,0:10:51.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老師 為什麼♂∴♀呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.43,0:10:53.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那也是秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.14,0:10:58.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老師難道是∷§∞？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.41,0:11:01.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都是秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.74,0:11:05.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什麼呀 這聲音
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.40,0:11:07.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 小泉在哪
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.67,0:11:10.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,社團活動
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.61,0:11:12.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,社團活動？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.74,0:11:14.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對的 MAITY部
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.70,0:11:16.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,MAITY部 那是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.87,0:11:20.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以研究MAITY老師的生活情況為主的社團
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.69,0:11:21.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.15,0:11:23.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊什麼啊 你這個該死的傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.67,0:11:26.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小信被理莎附身了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.08,0:11:28.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在生什麼氣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.55,0:11:30.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我都聽親愛的說了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.02,0:11:36.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都是大谷的錯 快想辦法阻止那個什麼MAITY部吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.67,0:11:38.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,為什麼是我的錯啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.61,0:11:42.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都是你只知道發呆 連親沒親都不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.95,0:11:44.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事情才會變這麼棘手
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.43,0:11:56.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要大谷小小道個歉 理莎就會消氣的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.71,0:11:58.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,道什麼歉啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.56,0:12:01.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,道什麼歉都好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.45,0:12:05.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然後叫她不要再搞那個冷到爆的社團 笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.84,0:12:06.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小信
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.20,0:12:10.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,MAITY MAITY MAITY MAITY
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.13,0:12:17.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,MAITY MAITY MAITY MAITY
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.38,0:12:32.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在幹什麼 怎麼沒去社團活動
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.66,0:12:35.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,顧問閃到腰 要休息一陣
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.63,0:12:45.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,MAITY命？ 你還是別搞那個了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.23,0:12:46.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這是別人的自由 要你管
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.82,0:12:54.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行 跟他單獨相處 會想起那件事的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.87,0:12:58.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,雖說是一時衝動 但我怎麼能幹出那種事
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.20,0:12:59.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,昨天 那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.86,0:13:01.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,夠了 別說了 別提那件事了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.27,0:13:05.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我感冒那天 真的親了小泉了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.93,0:13:07.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,夠了 我不是叫你別說了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.73,0:13:15.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.35,0:13:18.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對不起…對不起…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.04,0:13:24.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對不起？這是為什麼道歉？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.73,0:13:30.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是為了你不記得親我這件事道歉嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.32,0:13:38.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,還是 你無論如何沒辦法把我當女生看待 而道歉？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.96,0:13:44.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.08,0:13:57.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也不用做出這麼明顯的困擾表情吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.32,0:14:03.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算了 不用再想了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.61,0:14:07.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是說了嗎 我放棄了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.40,0:14:11.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這麼久以來給你添了很多麻煩 真是不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.02,0:14:12.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.22,0:14:14.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至於我的事 就不用你操心了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.74,0:14:16.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小泉…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.97,0:14:26.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.91,0:14:30.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,別走 別說你要放棄！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.17,0:14:33.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,還有點期待 希望他會這麼說
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.57,0:14:36.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不可能的 他怎麼會那麼說呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.99,0:14:37.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,準備回去了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.57,0:14:43.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊… 是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.38,0:14:50.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼了 發生什麼事了？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.88,0:15:14.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小泉真的很努力
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.19,0:15:17.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她是真的很喜歡大谷吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.16,0:15:23.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算我這麼喜歡大谷
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.05,0:15:25.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,還是不會有任何改變
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.06,0:15:31.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我再也不要喜歡大谷了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.28,0:16:07.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,還是算了 夠了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.45,0:16:19.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,M A I T Y Love MAITY
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.15,0:16:19.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,來
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.05,0:16:24.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,M A I T Y Love MAITY
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.62,0:16:26.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,聲音太小了 再來
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.87,0:16:31.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,M A I T Y Love MAITY
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.00,0:16:30.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已經沒有自信繼續跟理莎做朋友了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.14,0:16:33.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是MAITY部的社團活動嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.76,0:16:34.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.15,0:16:39.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以MAITY老師從今天起擔任籃球部的顧問
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.59,0:16:40.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,為什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.22,0:16:44.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是顧問腰傷痊癒之前的臨時任命 忍忍吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.87,0:16:47.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,為什麼偏偏讓他當臨時教練啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.25,0:16:49.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的 大谷你想想辦法吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.67,0:16:54.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再這樣下去 理莎真的會迷上那個噁心吧啦的人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.99,0:16:57.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那關我什麼事
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.67,0:17:00.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什麼叫不關你的事 明明就是你的錯
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.93,0:17:04.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什麼又是我的錯 明明是她自己要移情別戀的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.34,0:17:09.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等一下… 不要攻擊我可愛的小信
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.92,0:17:10.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.85,0:17:12.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被攻擊的明明是我好不好
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.90,0:17:18.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小泉同學
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.71,0:17:20.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,MAITY老師
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.97,0:17:22.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你精神恢復了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.43,0:17:24.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,昨天真是不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.38,0:17:25.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,雖然不知道發生了什麼事
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.14,0:17:27.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最好不要太勉強自己哦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.98,0:17:32.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是 也不是什麼大不了的事
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.99,0:17:36.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天我們會去籃球部為MAITY老師加油
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.93,0:17:38.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,謝謝你 那就拜託你了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.33,0:17:45.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,MAITY my love MAITY
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.37,0:17:50.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,MAITY 加油哦 好帥哦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.70,0:17:52.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,請多指教
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.10,0:17:54.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你會打籃球嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.51,0:17:55.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這個嘛 你說呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.79,0:17:58.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太卑鄙了 站住
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.79,0:18:05.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,MAITY MAITY
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.28,0:18:10.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,MAITY MAI…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.55,0:18:15.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,MAITY MAI…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.01,0:18:20.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的 搞什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.29,0:18:23.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 部長 我們要給MAITY老師加油啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.35,0:18:41.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,MAITY
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.79,0:18:35.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我高中一直都打籃球
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.56,0:18:41.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吵死了 讓人怎麼打球
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.58,0:18:43.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什麼嘛 真讓人生氣
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.52,0:18:45.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,MAITY 加油啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.43,0:18:54.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大谷
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.20,0:18:57.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再來一球
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.34,0:18:58.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.00,0:19:00.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大谷 我們的練習呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.85,0:19:01.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,囉嗦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.74,0:19:07.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,MAITY 加油
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.40,0:19:12.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,理莎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.49,0:19:16.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我說 你這樣真的好嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.28,0:19:17.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,無所謂
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.14,0:19:21.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我以後的青春 全都要獻給MAITY老師
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.02,0:19:23.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求求你不要
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.50,0:19:25.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我絕對不要你跟那種人在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.42,0:19:27.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,理莎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.71,0:19:29.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是我也沒辦法啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.07,0:19:31.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已經努力到現在
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.26,0:19:34.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可就算說放棄的時候 他也不阻止我
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.94,0:19:37.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 原來你們在這裡啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.96,0:19:39.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,親愛的 社團活動結束了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.52,0:19:40.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.22,0:19:41.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大谷呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.76,0:19:43.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在鬧彆扭 不知道跑哪去了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.95,0:19:46.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因為他一直都被MAITY老師搶走球
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.91,0:19:48.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他一定是沮喪地躲起來了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.34,0:19:51.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,理莎 你去找他 安慰一下他吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.13,0:19:53.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,幹嘛要我去
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.33,0:19:55.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,說不定這以後他就不打籃球了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.72,0:19:56.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那怎麼可能啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.02,0:20:04.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大谷同學
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.88,0:20:09.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什麼事？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.00,0:20:12.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有件事想問你 方便嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.19,0:20:13.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,請說
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.32,0:20:18.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,前幾天弄哭小泉的 是不是你
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.63,0:20:20.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.65,0:20:23.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你現在的表情很可怕哦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.65,0:20:26.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你煩不煩啊 噁心死了 是又怎麼樣
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.27,0:20:29.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,女孩子很容易受傷的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.46,0:20:31.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以一定要更溫柔地對待她們
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.68,0:20:36.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這跟你無關 不要你管
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.50,0:20:39.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小泉 大概是喜歡你的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.87,0:20:44.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那又怎樣
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.10,0:20:49.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在想 不知道你對小泉感覺如何
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.88,0:20:52.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那跟你無關
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.37,0:20:54.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那麼 我就要搶走她囉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.45,0:20:58.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,隨便你
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.36,0:20:59.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的可以嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.65,0:21:01.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都說了隨便你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.85,0:21:04.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,反正我對小泉什麼感覺都沒有
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.34,0:21:29.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,剛剛那句話 我沒聽錯吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.23,0:21:36.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我被同一個人 甩了兩次？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.11,0:23:07.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,MAITY老師…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.68,0:23:09.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,MAITY MAITY的叫 吵死了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.51,0:23:11.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要再參加那個噁心吧啦的MAITY部了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.11,0:23:12.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大谷你嫉妒了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.05,0:23:15.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戀愛情結 love com 次回
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.33,0:23:17.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,MAITY的魔法！變化的戀愛模樣！？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.33,0:23:18.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要看哦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:23:19.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
